WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:14.379
Ashley Christian: Raise your septic prices a little. Your customer won't feel it, but your margin will. I met with a client today whose investors gave them a list of changes, and one of them was raising prices.

2
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:30.220
Ashley Christian: They walked me through the list, and I told them honestly that these were good changes, especially the price increase. A small increase barely registers with the customer. I promise you, if they can already pay hundreds of dollars, they can pay a little bit more without even feeling it.

3
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:45.430
Ashley Christian: Over a year, it becomes the cushion that carries you through surprises. Margin isn't greed, it's how you get through the month the truck breaks down. If you've been putting off a price increase, you're not crazy for being nervous, but it's probably the first thing I'd look at.

